font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Portrait</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Francisco de Paula Santander</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick #437 (subtype/variety depending on date)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"colombia-banco-republica-2000-pesos-mariposa\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-2000-pesos-1996-error-mariposa.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-2000-pesos-1996-error-mariposa.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Two Thousand Pesos de The Bank of the Republic, enlarged view, mostrando el off-center cutting error\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">The Butterfly Bill &ldquo;&rdquo;</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Issued on April 2, 1996, this Two Thousand Pesos bill is popularly known in Colombia as &ldquo;the butterfly&rdquo; for the vignette of a butterfly next to a natural landscape that accompanies the portrait on the obverse &mdash;a nod to Colombian biodiversity in a design that, for the rest, continues to focus on a hero of independence.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>portrait of Francisco de Paula Santander, &ldquo;the Man of Laws&rdquo;, at right, with the butterfly and landscape vignette above.<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>the Bogotá Mint, in reddish and pink tones, with the coat of arms of Colombia.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">The Off-Center Cutting Error</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">This specimen presents a<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">off-center cut</strong>: the guillotine separating the banknotes from the printing sheet deviates &oacute; from its axis, leaving diagonally trimmed triangular corners on opposite sides of each &mdash; face visible on both the front and back&mdash; instead of the usual four right angles. It is a finishing defect, typical of the guillotining process, distinct from a printing error in the ink or color registration.</p>",
